; Such phrases present thought , speech , or the mind itself, as a region in which the wanderer is bewildered; cp. 310 :
El. 922 οὐκ οἶσθ’ ὅποι γῆς οὐδ’ ὅποι γνώμης φέρει : "thou knowest not whither or into what fancies thou art roaming" :
